 Executor Agents play a critical role in implementing Prime Agent strategies, as defined by their Executor Agent Accord with a particular Agent. Executor Agents are tasked with operationalizing Prime Agent strategies, and are able to directly update Agent Artifacts where sufficiently specific logic exists to do so.
 
-#### A.1.13.4.2 - Requirement For Executor Agent Accord [Core]  <!-- UUID: 5dca36a5-a9aa-4c8a-9c41-b2be94c0e12c -->
+#### A.1.14.4.2 - Requirement For Executor Agent Accord [Core]  <!-- UUID: 5dca36a5-a9aa-4c8a-9c41-b2be94c0e12c -->
 
 Executor Agents must partner with Prime Agents through a formal Executor Agent Accord. An Executor Agent may not carry out any executive functions for a particular Prime Agent without a formal Executor Agent Accord.
 
-#### A.1.13.4.3 - Adherence To An Executor Agent Accord [Core]  <!-- UUID: 8249a5d8-f7b1-4189-8901-ba4de330d031 -->
+#### A.1.14.4.3 - Adherence To An Executor Agent Accord [Core]  <!-- UUID: 8249a5d8-f7b1-4189-8901-ba4de330d031 -->
 
 Executor Agents must adhere to all specific rules and requirements set out in a relevant Executor Agent Accord they agree with a Prime Agent.
 
-#### A.1.13.4.4 - Ensuring Alignment With The Atlas [Core]  <!-- UUID: beb4109c-b425-42ef-afd6-9b52fe454268 -->
+#### A.1.14.4.4 - Ensuring Alignment With The Atlas [Core]  <!-- UUID: beb4109c-b425-42ef-afd6-9b52fe454268 -->
 
 Executor Agents must always ensure that a Prime Agent’s actions or processes are fully aligned with the text and spirit of the Atlas.
 
-##### A.1.13.4.4.1 - Executor Agent Alignment Requirements [Core]  <!-- UUID: b8cb6cf9-2904-49e8-b627-7907ba208adf -->
+##### A.1.14.4.4.1 - Executor Agent Alignment Requirements [Core]  <!-- UUID: b8cb6cf9-2904-49e8-b627-7907ba208adf -->
 
 The requirement for Executor Agents to check every Prime Agent action or process for alignment with the Atlas is fundamental. It cannot be amended or altered by either Prime Agents or Executor Agents.
 
-#### A.1.13.4.5 - Executor Agent Right Of Refusal [Core]  <!-- UUID: d20d3a11-0b46-4fb7-93dd-db473aa63665 -->
+#### A.1.14.4.5 - Executor Agent Right Of Refusal [Core]  <!-- UUID: d20d3a11-0b46-4fb7-93dd-db473aa63665 -->
 
 Executor Agents have the discretion to refuse to operationalize a Prime Agent’s update to their Agent Artifact, or any other action, if they consider that the action is either misaligned with the Atlas or presents significant risk beyond the Executor Agent’s insured capacity.
 
-#### A.1.13.4.6 - Executor Agent GovOps And Facilitator Actors [Core]  <!-- UUID: a878427f-64a8-430f-8576-70b6e34ef419 -->
+#### A.1.14.4.6 - Executor Agent GovOps And Facilitator Actors [Core]  <!-- UUID: a878427f-64a8-430f-8576-70b6e34ef419 -->
 
 Through GovOps and Facilitator Actors, Executor Agents supervise other Agents and carry out operational activities on behalf of Prime Agents related to the Sky Primitives.
 
-##### A.1.13.4.6.1 - Executor Agent GovOps And Facilitators [Core]  <!-- UUID: 6e4b1649-4d85-404e-a70d-ababba877d9e -->
+##### A.1.14.4.6.1 - Executor Agent GovOps And Facilitators [Core]  <!-- UUID: 6e4b1649-4d85-404e-a70d-ababba877d9e -->
 
 Executor Agents act exclusively through their associated GovOps and Facilitator actors.
 
-###### A.1.13.4.6.1.1 - Executor Agent GovOps [Core]  <!-- UUID: 76405733-3740-4c62-836f-c0683840a9a2 -->
+###### A.1.14.4.6.1.1 - Executor Agent GovOps [Core]  <!-- UUID: 76405733-3740-4c62-836f-c0683840a9a2 -->
 
 GovOps actors carry out operational activities on behalf of Executor Agents and, by extension, Prime Agents that Executor Agents have entered into Executor Accords with. With the exception of specific activities reserved for Executor Agent Facilitators, all activities of Executor Agents are carried out by GovOps.
 
-###### A.1.13.4.6.1.2 - Executor Agent Facilitators [Core]  <!-- UUID: 1b199df8-2bc3-4884-a60f-e45c3269fad4 -->
+###### A.1.14.4.6.1.2 - Executor Agent Facilitators [Core]  <!-- UUID: 1b199df8-2bc3-4884-a60f-e45c3269fad4 -->
 
 Executor Agent Facilitators are Facilitators that carry out specific activities on behalf of Executor Agents. Whenever an Executor Agent must interpret an Artifact, that interpretation must be done by the Facilitator. Whenever an Executor Agent has privileged access to smart contracts of Sky or an Agent, that access must be held by the Facilitator. Facilitators use this access to carry out the Executor Agent’s operational responsibilities as directed by GovOps, unless the Facilitator believes that GovOps is misaligned.
 
-#### A.1.13.4.7 - Executor Agent Short-Term Transitionary Measures [Core]  <!-- UUID: 4fce0fd5-cfba-48b6-9af5-bbb0b5e917a6 -->
+#### A.1.14.4.7 - Executor Agent Short-Term Transitionary Measures [Core]  <!-- UUID: 4fce0fd5-cfba-48b6-9af5-bbb0b5e917a6 -->
 
 The documents herein define short term transitionary measures during the launch of Executor Agents.
 
-##### A.1.13.4.7.1 - GovOps And Facilitators Acting As Executor Agents [Core]  <!-- UUID: 2dc20bcf-08d7-4314-a2f2-aee9b41940e1 -->
